body:
@kaneo/mcp 0.1.14 updates the MCP SDK to 1.32.2 and Zod to 4.6.7.

If your MCP client pins a package version, change it to `@kaneo/mcp@0.1.14` and restart the client. The package is available on [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@kaneo/mcp/v/0.1.14) and in the MCP Registry as `io.github.usekaneo/kaneo` version `0.1.14`.

The server-side authorization fixes are included in [Kaneo 2.47.1](https://github.com/usekaneo/kaneo/releases/tag/v2.47.1). Update your Kaneo instance as well.
